cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this Teaching-Learning Material (TLM) kit, CAD pipeline, slicer profiles, or dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "Low-Cost FDM Fabrication of an Age-Scaled Pediatric Upper-Limb Osteology TLM Kit (Payir Health Initiatives / Ideapattrai)"
authors:
